    "body": "## What and why\n\nRecord the first original-parent run of the coordinated Prefix learner delivered in #2079. The same fresh complete-donor credit produces four finite vector proposals; each lowers loss but violates a reference or protected winner. The larger rejected proposals offer conditional corrections that adjacent updates missed, identifying protected direction formation as the next causal question.\n\nThis PR delivers the canonical result, source-bound orchestration and saved arithmetic checker, exact artifacts/resources/preservation receipts, and updated overview/current-state documentation. No model source or serving behavior changes.\n\n## Result\n\n**REJECT the candidate for promotion; retain implementation and evidence.** On the fixed open-development conditional episode, original5/15 → candidate6/15 (EOS only); the separate adjacent candidate remains9/15. No Prefix vector commits;320 Generate updates are accepted from13,440 alternatives. All17 references/380 guards are preserved and391 native snapshots independently reload. All62 raw gradients and both aggregates are bitwise identical to the adjacent comparison. Accepted whole-answer development performance remains **8/512**; actual-nine/full512/fresh/multi-turn are NOT_RUN because construction is negative.\n\nThe exact executed Rust source `cc079744f4824e91a6ad739e2e7cf45c8d374527` passes the optimized CUDA build and25 scoped tests. Its model run takes301.403 seconds; separate saved arithmetic comparison passes. That checker does not independently regenerate native scores or backwards. Final delivery head `4b95c4c6a65c5b3c94d7d8545a64b044ddafacd6` has identical Rust/Cargo inputs; its helper syntax, JSON, configuration/report/checker identities, claim wording and diff checks pass. Exact-head independent review is recorded before merge.\n\nAll599 outcome files are verified in private storage and iCloud, including a fresh local archive-member check. The pod was released/deleted:983 seconds uptime, approximately$0.325 at$1.19/h. Full preparation/build/delivery accounting is separate from model time.\n\n## Checklist\n\n- [x] Checks run at this exact head (commands and outcomes posted on this PR)\n- [x] Research record: `docs/labs/prefix-vector-run-2026-10-09/README.md`\n- [x] New entry at the top of `docs/integration/current-state.md`, with **Next:**\n- [x] Every document this change makes stale is updated; historical implementation NOT_RUN is explicitly dated\n- [x] STATUS.md / ROADMAP.md / #2028 table: accepted model and milestone status unchanged\n- [x] README updated within existing Training section; crate README updated\n- [x] `python3 scripts/check_claim_wording.py` passes\n- [x] After merge: verify on fresh `origin/main`, delete the branch and worktree, apply hygiene, then report on M2\n\nReferences #2030\n",
